ts and ideas and look forward to working together to achieve our goals.\n\nThe meeting will be chaired by [Name] and will be attended by a number of senior team members. We will also have a number of guest speakers who will be sharing their expertise and insights on a range of topics.\n\nIn terms of logistics we will be providing refreshments and there will be ample opportunity for networking and discussion. We ask that you arrive at least 15 minutes prior to the start time to allow for registration and setup.\n\nIf you are unable to attend the meeting please let us know as soon as possible so that we can make alternative arrangements. We will also be sending out a survey to all participants after the meeting to gather feedback and suggestions for future meetings.\n\nWe are excited to invite you to this meeting and look forward to hearing from you soon. If you have any questions or concerns please do not hesitate to contact us.\n\nThank you for your participation and we look forward to seeing you on [Date].\n\nBest regards\n[Your Name]\n\nCC: [List of CC recipients]", "logprobs": [{"token": "Subject", "logprob": -0.00045658654}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.08251436}, {"token": " Invitation", "logprob": -0.056845877}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.0012036468}, {"token": " Join", "logprob": -2.122341}, {"token": " Our", "logprob": -1.6455823}, {"token": " Meeting", "logprob": -2.2935102}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.83690464}, {"token": " Strategic", "logprob": -1.6114919}, {"token": " Planning", "logprob": -0.17503007}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.14262982}, {"token": "Dear", "logprob": -0.0024832622}, {"token": " Participants", "logprob": -1.26368}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.14463553}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.32738176}, {"token": " am", "logprob": -0.636924}, {"token": " writing", "logprob": -0.09555098}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.0002460177}, {"token": " formally", "logprob": -0.45090988}, {"token": " invite", "logprob": -0.016353622}, {"to